          "content": {
            "size": 126528,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"trending\":[{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"description\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPOn6DinuVyLY17YM9mKuPofV08.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qeQJx07rK2xm8SD2sJxFKhE7gs0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1368337,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/RMXG8myu1aGlNUsRjtxzmpdMK0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1284041,\"title\":\"The Last House\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A family suddenly sealed inside their home must work together to survive against dwindling resources and the ominous threat keeping them trapped.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JU7E8Vv2M11egkctWVOScxWR75.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2mPmccLg8QCD4ZF6v8kSsUijPPW.jpg\"},{\"id\":1212763,\"title\":\"Evil Dead Burn\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"description\":\"After her husband's abrupt death, Alice seeks solace with his remaining family — descendants of a leading researcher on demonic possession. As her in-laws transform one by one into creatures that feed on fear, she comes to discover that the vows she took in life survive even in death.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRxrNXQWkHoENm3nwVOZDYSCx2F.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A5Tz6ogGt4VV8NESG9oWVct5bo1.jpg\"},{\"id\":1339713,\"title\":\"Obsession\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"After breaking the mysterious \\\"One Wish Willow\\\" to win his crush's heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRwnj8WEKBCvmfeUNOukJPwB43K.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rZfmzpixLKLR3Hg2u0WgC7XLFl8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1081003,\"title\":\"Supergirl\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"When an unexpected and ruthless adversary strikes too close to home, Kara Zor-El, aka Supergirl, reluctantly joins forces with an unlikely companion on an epic, interstellar journey of vengeance and justice.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QCWdqzTfh2x9UylVpspIU6QTuM.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4X2YSe8PaYbsBqX3TDmmIU4vOju.jpg\"},{\"id\":94997,\"title\":\"House of the Dragon\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Action & Adventure\"],\"description\":\"The Targaryen dynasty is at the absolute apex of its power, with more than 15 dragons under their yoke. Most empires crumble from such heights. In the case of the Targaryens, their slow fall begins when King Viserys breaks with a century of tradition by naming his daughter Rhaenyra heir to the Iron Throne. But when Viserys later fathers a son, the court is shocked when Rhaenyra retains her status as his heir, and seeds of division sow friction across the realm.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7V0Ebks0GgpKvQ7QbLAIdX5dos4.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/577eXC8wFQT0eUrJcgznSiFPRmk.jpg\"},{\"id\":30984,\"title\":\"Bleach\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2004,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"For as long as he can remember, Ichigo Kurosaki has been able to see ghosts. But when he meets Rukia, a Soul Reaper who battles evil spirits known as Hollows, he finds his life is changed forever. Now, with a newfound wealth of spiritual energy, Ichigo discovers his true calling: to protect the living and the dead from evil.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EewmxXe72ogD0EaWM8gqa0ccIw.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o0NsbcIvsllg6CJX0FBFY8wWbsn.jpg\"},{\"id\":97546,\"title\":\"Ted Lasso\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2020,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Ted Lasso, an American football coach, moves to England when he's hired to manage a soccer team—despite having no experience. With cynical players and a doubtful town, will he get them to see the Ted Lasso Way?\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRHsiw1wLxPHFXkkv4Ix1s0O6f4.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3KLmx6nLaiYe07kSwuWdpTEHJgE.jpg\"},{\"id\":125988,\"title\":\"Silo\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"In a ruined and toxic future, thousands live in a giant silo deep underground. After its sheriff breaks a cardinal rule and residents die mysteriously, engineer Juliette starts to uncover shocking secrets and the truth about the silo.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMYZZvnkVNTqSVnVCphWbPXwWwb.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uTWhbLc7Bj4qNSdW3ZvZKL8cOHv.jpg\"},{\"id\":298168,\"title\":\"The Shards\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.8,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"description\":\"17-year-old Bret Easton Ellis is in his final year at the elite Buckley prep school. Upending his world is the arrival of a mysterious new student, Robert Mallory, whose unsettling presence coincides with the activities of a serial killer known as The Trawler.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wP0GdqwVu2g1y3q1KzBXuSrdTvX.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vTzfZ55Qp1GP3uKGSMlsLEYrn6.jpg\"},{\"id\":291496,\"title\":\"Our Sticky Love\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"An ambitious prosecutor loses her memory and moves in with a boxing coach who claims to be her boyfriend. Can this sticky situation turn into real love?\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSZ4aFpTGc8Oj52SuzPUUZ7WKL0.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mp2AFsWsuyxCzenJh3DTKw7z4jG.jpg\"},{\"id\":113962,\"title\":\"Lioness\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War & Politics\"],\"description\":\"Cruz Manuelos, a rough-around-the-edges but passionate young Marine, is recruited to join the CIA's Lioness Engagement Team to help bring down a terrorist organization from within. Joe, the station chief of the Lioness program, is tasked with training, managing and leading her female undercover operatives.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzpHPSEgPTpRs8EHbygwsOw7jC0.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4NBYDOnEjAzyuP7CMkD5s7fs44K.jpg\"},{\"id\":289324,\"title\":\"Star Wars: Visions Presents - The Ninth Jedi\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Action & Adventure\"],\"description\":\"Kara and her ragtag Jedi crew seek out to find worthy Jedi to fight against an increasingly powerful warlord.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AthqHRKJFOIbLa459I3D5yHdrQL.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ln6DSOJKJUSt1IETsfHkFj6rMY.jpg\"},{\"id\":1307118,\"title\":\"Soulm8te\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.2,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"After a ruthless tech giant acquires a small robotics company, a grieving engineer is tasked with testing their new AI companion. But when he attempts to reprogram her to be a truly sentient soulmate, she develops needs of her own—unleashing a relentless spree of precision-engineered mayhem.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNErActDctl6cdUGw9pnjSCmyhQ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ebcOSaZLxdCMHDjJJQzx5PiEyzl.jpg\"},{\"id\":1083381,\"title\":\"Backrooms\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"A strange doorway appears in the basement of a furniture showroom.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhGx6E3qRNMgj3i5su2oukNHwIQ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dqmMWNWfLnExDRpMtIMqI97GQFR.jpg\"},{\"id\":283297,\"title\":\"Sterling Point\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"After discovering she's inherited a remote island in Canada from the estranged grandfather she was never allowed to meet, 17-year-old Annie Jacobson decides to investigate, pulling her into a world of buried secrets, unexpected sisterhood, and the complicated family history she was never meant to find.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cThLWEGs6BEqY0QZMbU4FAeWwPT.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ebLym6w04CzYJBLZScB1rrzm6uY.jpg\"},{\"id\":615,\"title\":\"Futurama\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":1999,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"The adventures of a late-20th-century New York City pizza delivery boy, Philip J. Fry, who, after being unwittingly cryogenically frozen for one thousand years, finds employment at Planet Express, an interplanetary delivery company in the retro-futuristic 31st century.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eM8bbTn8C8vUwwS6upzzm7gX31u.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4xKG4S1IyLIglHbCYGJDsptgQNh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1679730,\"title\":\"THE RIBBON HERO\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"description\":\"When the monstrous Nergal devastates her kingdom, Princess Sapphire reawakens as the Ribbon Hero and fights to save her new home from the same dark fate.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUCkV0iODxbULZQ5vRN1sDjPrpk.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8SEb8rEZ9DYqBT7U3FI5nBOS1lV.jpg\"},{\"id\":207333,\"title\":\"One Hundred Years of Solitude\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2024,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"In the mythical town Macondo, seven generations of the Buendía family navigate love, oblivion and the inescapability of their past — and their fate.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zrvktj9JYQwQxZD4lAySfcYlmI.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5mcc7J07f680Q88xeLClf5SIZtt.jpg\"}],\"upcoming\":[{\"id\":1368337,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/RMXG8myu1aGlNUsRjtxzmpdMK0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1339713,\"title\":\"Obsession\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"After breaking the mysterious \\\"One Wish Willow\\\" to win his crush's heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRwnj8WEKBCvmfeUNOukJPwB43K.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rZfmzpixLKLR3Hg2u0WgC7XLFl8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1284465,\"title\":\"The Death of Robin Hood\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.2,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"description\":\"Grappling with his past after a life of crime and murder, Robin Hood finds himself gravely injured after a battle he thought would be his last. In the hands of a mysterious woman, he is offered a chance at salvation.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92Tsfx7SFafOqWsotvrlJbHyehd.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lh3BDkmWJh998n4fQcHYcVi7dpm.jpg\"},{\"id\":1108427,\"title\":\"Moana\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"description\":\"Teenage Moana answers the Ocean's call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with infamous demigod Maui on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKVgiv5qHCvCLT4A2ymJi5QeXDH.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c6BPbkO5Npt1OdwttAxCFo06wtH.jpg\"},{\"id\":1315772,\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.2,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nz7i42yhLIJ4ve9JKgM6NthoLHO.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1375646,\"title\":\"Colony\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Professor Se-jeong is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN799oUR0f1gUKDYdMNrDaY7I51.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDvxsBemt2Iyslg7qn2WMzgxz23.jpg\"},{\"id\":1564614,\"title\":\"Leviticus\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"Two teenage boys must escape a violent entity that takes the form of the person they desire most:  each other.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnAsZvBygplNpp8PtjoTEYv3VPB.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7y8zWGEjs7tresw4Hzkkf4TdkcL.jpg\"},{\"id\":1523145,\"title\":\"Your Heart Will Be Broken\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"High school student Polina is saved from bullying at her new school and makes a deal with the main bully Bars: he must pretend to be her boyfriend and protect her, and she must do everything he says. During this game, the couple develops real feelings, but her family and classmates have reasons to separate the lovers.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wIBfBl2gejt6xHxNSK0reVIm7E.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1x9e0qWonw634NhIsRdvnneeqvN.jpg\"},{\"id\":936075,\"title\":\"Michael\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"The story of Michael Jackson, one of the most influential artists the world has ever known, and his life beyond the music. His journey from the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five, to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the world, highlighting both his life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm0KAbOjlt9eR5y7vDiL2dEOwMl.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ufSwlnECLoUbBjPrFqEQcWBzHwc.jpg\"},{\"id\":1594914,\"title\":\"Lucky Strike\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"War\"],\"description\":\"A wounded American soldier fights to survive behind enemy lines during WWII's Battle of the Bulge against the Germans, relying on his instinct, spy craft and a hand-radio to evade capture and find his way back to his unit.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzRAd7mj39ZY3FGNrDdZjqx56tn.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1ebY06Gc1eUZcCoO7IoD4tWCFxm.jpg\"},{\"id\":1127384,\"title\":\"Deep Water\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A group of international passengers on a flight from Los Angeles to Shanghai is forced to make an emergency landing in shark-infested waters. The terrified group is forced to work together and overcome their differences if they hope to escape their sinking plane and the frenzy of sharks drawn to the wreckage.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjcuS7xaRyqRjVaVcH4t0qHshuX.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/szKv713FcUXx6hcfdY369vtkmzr.jpg\"},{\"id\":1419406,\"title\":\"The Shadow's Edge\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"Macau Police brings the tracking expert police officer out of retirement to help catch a dangerous group of professional thieves.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHKo3m8N1fwvEy2ZEr0xGmmMODV.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BtL2vvEufDXDP4u6xQjjQ1Y2aT.jpg\"},{\"id\":1290821,\"title\":\"Shelter\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A man living in self-imposed exile on a remote island rescues a young girl from a violent storm, setting off a chain of events that forces him out of seclusion to protect her from enemies tied to his past.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buPFnHZ3xQy6vZEHxbHgL1Pc6CR.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nHxWyy18SvAZ8jJeemtS8k1UNjM.jpg\"},{\"id\":1469342,\"title\":\"Her Private Hell\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.8,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"When a mysterious mist engulfs a futuristic metropolis, unleashing a deadly and elusive entity, a troubled young woman searches for her father. Her quest collides with an American GI on a harrowing odyssey to rescue his daughter from Hell.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiFacg75KVjy0AM3S4QmbPas8zL.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hS4FcOM5y71FurkBQgDLTBxmWZh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1516698,\"title\":\"The Last Sunrise\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":0,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Ry, a college student with a chronic illness escapes to Mallorca for the summer with her mother, where she unexpectedly falls for a local and begins to embrace living in the moment. But as her condition worsens and long-hidden family secrets come to light, everything she has found before summer's end is threatened.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pego3yEZ5SuGvRjESKAguL4Wu7M.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lB7yPaRhJHQ9dx7AnvPUi0GZDU.jpg\"},{\"id\":671,\"title\":\"Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2001,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"Harry Potter has lived under the stairs at his aunt and uncle's house his whole life. But on his 11th birthday, he learns he's a powerful wizard—with a place waiting for him at the Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry. As he learns to harness his newfound powers with the help of the school's kindly headmaster, Harry uncovers the truth about his parents' deaths—and about the villain who's to blame.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuMc08IPKEatf9rnMNXvIDxqP4W.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1XAC6RPT01UX9EQGy2JVn5c8pgy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1325734,\"title\":\"The Drama\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg\"},{\"id\":1122573,\"title\":\"In the Grey\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.8,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A covert team of elite operatives are living in the shadows. When a ruthless despot steals a billion-dollar fortune, they're sent to take it back—an impossible heist that erupts into a deadly game of strategy, deception and survival.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQgIcW6Th08kMRf2HBoYWoFE6OD.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qcIKxhqGMIj8uujsSoSMZWr8QqU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1101383,\"title\":\"The End of Oak Street\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.8,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, the Platt family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SifFCwwFzXdU1Ew0nA4Z92Bs15.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b9q9VmbXDvJmTziRqkwdEmFdwhr.jpg\"},{\"id\":1307247,\"title\":\"OK! Madam: Bon Voyage\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":0,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Six years after the Hawaii airplane hijacking, Mi-yeong finds herself struggling with her rebellious teenage daughter, Nari, and her unemployed husband, Seok-hwan. When Hyun-min, a flight attendant she met during the hijacking, invites her family to his wedding aboard a luxury cruise ship, Mi-yeong eagerly proposes a family holiday. Met with indifference from her husband and daughter, she decides to embark alone, joining Hyun-min's family and Ji-hoon, a charming magician. However, on the eve of the wedding, the celebration turns deadly when armed assailants seize the ship. After Seok-hwan and Nari are kidnapped and brought aboard, Mi-yeong discovers that she is the target of a much larger plot.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDbrWXB9yb5aEdt4peVy8OWNP2Y.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ddrLCUT8hqSlEICTTbdlFYB5q4a.jpg\"},{\"id\":94997,\"title\":\"House of the Dragon\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Action & Adventure\"],\"description\":\"The Targaryen dynasty is at the absolute apex of its power, with more than 15 dragons under their yoke. Most empires crumble from such heights. In the case of the Targaryens, their slow fall begins when King Viserys breaks with a century of tradition by naming his daughter Rhaenyra heir to the Iron Throne. But when Viserys later fathers a son, the court is shocked when Rhaenyra retains her status as his heir, and seeds of division sow friction across the realm.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7V0Ebks0GgpKvQ7QbLAIdX5dos4.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/etj8E2o0Bud0HkONVQPjyCkIvpv.jpg\"},{\"id\":113962,\"title\":\"Lioness\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War & Politics\"],\"description\":\"Cruz Manuelos, a rough-around-the-edges but passionate young Marine, is recruited to join the CIA's Lioness Engagement Team to help bring down a terrorist organization from within. Joe, the station chief of the Lioness program, is tasked with training, managing and leading her female undercover operatives.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzpHPSEgPTpRs8EHbygwsOw7jC0.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4NBYDOnEjAzyuP7CMkD5s7fs44K.jpg\"},{\"id\":125988,\"title\":\"Silo\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"In a ruined and toxic future, thousands live in a giant silo deep underground. After its sheriff breaks a cardinal rule and residents die mysteriously, engineer Juliette starts to uncover shocking secrets and the truth about the silo.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMYZZvnkVNTqSVnVCphWbPXwWwb.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uTWhbLc7Bj4qNSdW3ZvZKL8cOHv.jpg\"},{\"id\":22980,\"title\":\"Watch What Happens Live with Andy Cohen\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":2.5,\"release_year\":2009,\"genres\":[\"Talk\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Bravo network executive Andy Cohen discusses pop culture topics with celebrities and reality show personalities.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onSD9UXfJwrMXWhq7UY7hGF2S1h.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hINekSpbcBxjnjGqmIm6I4bz2ab.jpg\"},{\"id\":108978,\"title\":\"Reacher\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"description\":\"Jack Reacher, a veteran military police investigator, has just recently entered civilian life. Reacher is a drifter, carrying no phone and the barest of essentials as he travels the country and explores the nation he once served.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1VCQIG2iCyOookdgOzwtUpwWC0.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/JYgqp8g2kI3SEus9XBDSHukfBN.jpg\"},{\"id\":59941,\"title\":\"The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":2.9,\"release_year\":2014,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Talk\"],\"description\":\"After Jay Leno's second retirement from the program, Jimmy Fallon stepped in as his permanent replacement. After 42 years in Los Angeles the program was brought back to New York.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1N4o5PmmqhlVDrcdJ2RlCFWbLGX.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7VO04TtL1jIT6XOPs9u4jdB8KaB.jpg\"},{\"id\":94664,\"title\":\"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2021,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"When a 34-year-old underachiever gets run over by a truck, his story doesn't end there. Reincarnated in a new world as an infant, Rudy will seize every opportunity to live the life he's always wanted. Armed with new friends, some freshly acquired magical abilities, and the courage to do the things he's always dreamed of, he's embarking on an epic adventure—with all of his past experience intact!\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLKOYIMyKlUHW0SVdskhgf9C0yy.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j9fRIimor0AMFJR9kjZubXcABzZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":97546,\"title\":\"Ted Lasso\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2020,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Ted Lasso, an American football coach, moves to England when he's hired to manage a soccer team—despite having no experience. With cynical players and a doubtful town, will he get them to see the Ted Lasso Way?\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRHsiw1wLxPHFXkkv4Ix1s0O6f4.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3KLmx6nLaiYe07kSwuWdpTEHJgE.jpg\"},{\"id\":261471,\"title\":\"Stand-up Comedy\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":2.9,\"release_year\":2024,\"genres\":[\"Talk\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"A professional comedy talk show competition program, the program invites outstanding stand-up artists at home and abroad to share happiness, convey a positive attitude to life and comedy spirit.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFJYt5Pi5Pjc3CKU58oonfXRCio.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sGK1f1Y2dnExqpjRnsHpI4ZWqJr.jpg\"},{\"id\":30984,\"title\":\"Bleach\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2004,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"For as long as he can remember, Ichigo Kurosaki has been able to see ghosts. But when he meets Rukia, a Soul Reaper who battles evil spirits known as Hollows, he finds his life is changed forever. Now, with a newfound wealth of spiritual energy, Ichigo discovers his true calling: to protect the living and the dead from evil.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EewmxXe72ogD0EaWM8gqa0ccIw.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o0NsbcIvsllg6CJX0FBFY8wWbsn.jpg\"},{\"id\":615,\"title\":\"Futurama\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":1999,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"The adventures of a late-20th-century New York City pizza delivery boy, Philip J. Fry, who, after being unwittingly cryogenically frozen for one thousand years, finds employment at Planet Express, an interplanetary delivery company in the retro-futuristic 31st century.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eM8bbTn8C8vUwwS6upzzm7gX31u.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4xKG4S1IyLIglHbCYGJDsptgQNh.jpg\"},{\"id\":2661,\"title\":\"Kamen Rider\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.2,\"release_year\":1971,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Takeshi Hongo is a promising young man with a passion for motorcycle racing. However, his dreams are suddenly ruined when he gets kidnapped by Shocker, the evil secret organization planning to dominate the world. After being remodeled into a cyborg, Takeshi escapes and swears to protect the world from the inhuman monsters.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DIBDFHiKQawz4WPsYekl9DHwyA.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/usLRh1bcbL0Q9X8zf6rL4OV1qrA.jpg\"},{\"id\":33238,\"title\":\"Running Man\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2010,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Reality\"],\"description\":\"These days, as variety shows are gradually disappearing, this is one of Korea’s representative variety shows that has been responsible for Sunday evenings for over 10 years. This program features numerous stars and members going around various places, playing games, and completing missions. In particular, among the many fun elements of variety shows, this one focuses solely on laughter.\\n\\nOpen your eyes! Big fun is coming in!\\n\\nOpen your mouth! Big laughter is coming in!\\n\\nOpen your heart! Useful lessons are coming in!\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Wmmu1MkqxJ48J7aySET9EKEjXz.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wsHj4oHQJoe7DMYaqNFwVoyLiAh.jpg\"},{\"id\":13945,\"title\":\"Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":2.7,\"release_year\":1992,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Soap\"],\"description\":\"Gute Zeiten, schlechte Zeiten is a long-running German television soap opera, first broadcast on RTL in 1992. The programme concerns the lives of a fictional neighborhood in Germany's capital city Berlin. Over the years the soap opera tends to have an overhaul of young people in their late teens and early twenties; targeting a young viewership.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qujVFLAlBnPU9mZElV4NZgL8iXT.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ottT2Yt0OfHiHp3PHJTLNVV8JPE.jpg\"},{\"id\":223911,\"title\":\"Renegade Immortal\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Action & Adventure\"],\"description\":\"It tells the story of Wang Lin, an ordinary young man in the countryside, who is moved by his heart and cultivates against immortality. His pursuit is not only for longevity, but also for getting rid of the ants behind it. He firmly believed in human beings and entered the path of cultivation with mediocre qualifications. After experiencing ups and downs, with his wise mind, he gradually reached the pinnacle and became famous in the cultivation world with his own strength.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCt5qgkOYEvuHSiSwNByMv6LMoB.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/crn53sSGWRZ8wAtEGso52nepEkz.jpg\"},{\"id\":91555,\"title\":\"All Elite Wrestling: Dynamite\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"A world-class roster of diverse male and female wrestlers give fans a new wrestling experience for the first time in 20 years.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPNWVCp0zrHRmwfovUpUQO44sts.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/veIrzS2AkYm0UaYYcVw9ziWkJoB.jpg\"},{\"id\":45140,\"title\":\"Teen Titans Go!\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.2,\"release_year\":2013,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"Robin, Starfire, Raven, Beast Boy and Cyborg return in all-new, comedic adventures. They may be super heroes who save the world every day ... but somebody still has to do the laundry!\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPKAigYUlWRpnfo4Ptiwlz4FWXU.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bIHCUqaapZdRjd2kzSDiwzYyrpC.jpg\"},{\"id\":278624,\"title\":\"Lucky\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"description\":\"When a multi-million-dollar heist goes sideways, con artist Lucky is forced to go on the run. Pursued by both the FBI and a ruthless crime boss, Lucky must fight for her life—and a way out.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsrkiXg8EuNNtbPtbmvCxg95gK7.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hKXMOOvQwXiL01hfYG5nrkH0tEP.jpg\"},{\"id\":138502,\"title\":\"X-Men '97\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2024,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"The X-Men, a band of mutants who use their uncanny gifts to protect a world that hates and fears them, are challenged like never before, forced to face a dangerous and unexpected new future.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HKBc5UiFw8JrruHq8S1Y7TnlW0.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jIyEmnBrZtl6SEWyBoMO2hZnzMa.jpg\"},{\"id\":57532,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":2013,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Kids\"],\"description\":\"Marshall, Rocky, Rubble, Zuma and Skye are doing their best to protect the people of their town. Led by Ryder, a tech-savvy 10-year-old boy, each of them is equipped with special equipment and together they help anyone who finds themselves in trouble. No task is too big for them and no puppy is too small.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HXkgUBO5OF8ZK9XbY69RM4S5rv.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7OrV2aAH5Yp7hA9zCCvUloLvZtl.jpg\"}],\"genreRows\":{\"Comedy\":[{\"id\":1084244,\"title\":\"Toy Story 5\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"description\":\"When Bonnie receives a Lilypad tablet as a gift and becomes obsessed, Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang's jobs become exponentially harder when they have to go head to head with the all-new threat to playtime.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfQtVlIHljToOwYjhe21KPGzZWK.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8sSKdEmlmqF4kJUd28SqthXC4yZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1108427,\"title\":\"Moana\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"description\":\"Teenage Moana answers the Ocean's call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with infamous demigod Maui on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKVgiv5qHCvCLT4A2ymJi5QeXDH.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c6BPbkO5Npt1OdwttAxCFo06wtH.jpg\"},{\"id\":1315772,\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.2,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nz7i42yhLIJ4ve9JKgM6NthoLHO.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1273221,\"title\":\"Scary Movie\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.2,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Twenty-six years after outrunning a suspiciously familiar masked killer, the Core Four are back in the killer's crosshairs and no horror movie IP is safe.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znHT8peERZRWG1ME3r0Db0EV8k8.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xWBiXclrRmTggQHMRsIn84YHavs.jpg\"},{\"id\":82976,\"title\":\"The Novices\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.4,\"release_year\":1970,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Sister Agnès runs away from her convent in Brittany and seeks refuge in Paris with prostitute Mona Lisa. With absolutely no qualifications, the young novice has a hard job finding work, so Mona Lisa tries to teach her the ropes of the oldest profession of them all!\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2SnSbRxMB4vktOxZapaspY2fTC.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yhGCxn4pYIQhK52g6JjM4bL9fVX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1314481,\"title\":\"The Devil Wears Prada 2\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Andy Sachs returns to Runway as Miranda Priestly navigates a new media landscape and Runway's position within. The duo reconnect with former assistant Emily Charlton, now the head of a luxury brand that possesses funding which could ensure Runway's survival.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTI42pmsP5EDnvsNJPEDubwWBQO.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Af907x5h9W1wVis8XrSd7ynTWuy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1226863,\"title\":\"The Super Mario Galaxy Movie\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Animation\"],\"description\":\"Having thwarted Bowser's previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir's crusade.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg\"},{\"id\":1084242,\"title\":\"Zootopia 2\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.8,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\",\"Family\"],\"description\":\"After cracking the biggest case in Zootopia's history, rookie cops Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a great mystery when Gary De'Snake arrives and turns the animal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJ7g2CifqpStmoYQyaLQgEU32qO.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lgotja3xMoJZbynwHfcQcJAEMWH.jpg\"},{\"id\":949838,\"title\":\"72 HOURS\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"description\":\"To save his career, a 40-year-old ad exec joins a crew of twentysomethings for a wild Miami bachelor party after they mistakenly add him to a group chat.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Bu1PW2R1XayqRqnl0aDOgMcrdS.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hL5EIk48251OXlbIbRJq3yaBHk8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1327819,\"title\":\"Hoppers\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Scientists have discovered how to 'hop' human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals. Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries within the animal world beyond anything she could have imagined.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjtWQ2CL1mpmMNwuU5HeS4Iuwuu.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Jj0A10NVu2dWnoEL5t5oT79L1Y.jpg\"},{\"id\":98894,\"title\":\"Jessica\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.1,\"release_year\":1962,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"When the men of a Sicilian village start obsessing over ravishing blonde midwife Jessica, angry females revolt by refusing to have sex with their husbands. As the local priest tries to encourage procreation, Jessica falls for a tricky recluse.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emXHuiMFjPuYKBE9FeIkmQNNmy.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dppTzXUPcEswCge1CoYcGOUV76m.jpg\"},{\"id\":533535,\"title\":\"Deadpool & Wolverine\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.8,\"release_year\":2024,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"A listless Wade Wilson toils away in civilian life with his days as the morally flexible mercenary, Deadpool, behind him. But when his homeworld faces an existential threat, Wade must reluctantly suit-up again with an even more reluctant Wolverine.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/by8z9Fe8y7p4jo2YlW2SZDnptyT.jpg\"},{\"id\":329505,\"title\":\"Lola's Secret\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":1984,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"description\":\"A young man's dreams come true when the sexy new maid seduces him. But she has a secret that leads to trouble.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaJ4iQngrLbyz9OgaQkJLppDN6m.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tId87yE7JnQsQsqOpnGXjz9PoEe.jpg\"},{\"id\":1325734,\"title\":\"The Drama\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg\"},{\"id\":1307247,\"title\":\"OK! Madam: Bon Voyage\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":0,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Six years after the Hawaii airplane hijacking, Mi-yeong finds herself struggling with her rebellious teenage daughter, Nari, and her unemployed husband, Seok-hwan. When Hyun-min, a flight attendant she met during the hijacking, invites her family to his wedding aboard a luxury cruise ship, Mi-yeong eagerly proposes a family holiday. Met with indifference from her husband and daughter, she decides to embark alone, joining Hyun-min's family and Ji-hoon, a charming magician. However, on the eve of the wedding, the celebration turns deadly when armed assailants seize the ship. After Seok-hwan and Nari are kidnapped and brought aboard, Mi-yeong discovers that she is the target of a much larger plot.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDbrWXB9yb5aEdt4peVy8OWNP2Y.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ddrLCUT8hqSlEICTTbdlFYB5q4a.jpg\"},{\"id\":599335,\"title\":\"OK! Madam\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":2020,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Action\"],\"description\":\"A working class family wins a free vacation to Hawaii. But when their plane takes flight, it gets hijacked by terrorists. To save her family and the other passengers, the wife must reveal her secret past and fight back.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Pl5mC3AptB2xsEhByYUZ4E9sXU.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1JDWXjOiv5VqYM2G50zK9mYyefu.jpg\"},{\"id\":1301421,\"title\":\"The Sheep Detectives\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Mystery\"],\"description\":\"George Hardy is a shepherd who reads detective novels to his beloved sheep every night, assuming they can't possibly understand. But when a mysterious incident disrupts life on the farm, the sheep realize they must become the detectives. As they follow the clues and investigate human suspects, they prove that even sheep can be brilliant crime-solvers.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGWOmj2jHFol3kOGNv1EhbSDDE1.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a8uQvrplTkhGJQog6GZ6CqF8An6.jpg\"},{\"id\":803796,\"title\":\"KPop Demon Hunters\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Comedy\",\"Animation\"],\"description\":\"When K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey aren't selling out stadiums, they're using their secret powers to protect their fans from supernatural threats.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zT7Lhw3BhJbMkRqm9Zlx2YGMsY0.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w3Bi0wygeFQctn6AqFTwhGNXRwL.jpg\"},{\"id\":1241982,\"title\":\"Moana 2\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":2024,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"After receiving an unexpected call from her wayfinding ancestors, Moana journeys alongside Maui and a new crew to the far seas of Oceania and into dangerous, long-lost waters for an adventure unlike anything she's ever faced.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLVkiINlIeCkcZIzb7XHzPYgO6L.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vYqt6kb4lcF8wwqsMMaULkP9OEn.jpg\"},{\"id\":1297842,\"title\":\"GOAT\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"description\":\"A small goat with big dreams gets a once-in-a-lifetime shot to join the pros and play roarball, a high-intensity, co-ed, full-contact sport dominated by the fastest, fiercest animals in the world.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfuqMlaExcoYiUEvKfVpUTt1v4u.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tq3h43fZy0H80vzf47MAY7R9Mxo.jpg\"}],\"Drama\":[{\"id\":1284465,\"title\":\"The Death of Robin Hood\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.2,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"description\":\"Grappling with his past after a life of crime and murder, Robin Hood finds himself gravely injured after a battle he thought would be his last. In the hands of a mysterious woman, he is offered a chance at salvation.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92Tsfx7SFafOqWsotvrlJbHyehd.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lh3BDkmWJh998n4fQcHYcVi7dpm.jpg\"},{\"id\":47612,\"title\":\"Au Bonheur des Dames\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.1,\"release_year\":1930,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"Denise, an orphaned girl, moves to Paris where she hopes to find work at her uncle's store. But the glamorous department store 'Aux Bonheur des Dames' across the street crushes all the little businesses around. She finds a position there.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVFvFFEMRJ1eUzD6nbYLSqwHi0d.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o5bRLCNBmWBCBluFlOLUgivdONs.jpg\"},{\"id\":82976,\"title\":\"The Novices\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.4,\"release_year\":1970,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Sister Agnès runs away from her convent in Brittany and seeks refuge in Paris with prostitute Mona Lisa. With absolutely no qualifications, the young novice has a hard job finding work, so Mona Lisa tries to teach her the ropes of the oldest profession of them all!\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2SnSbRxMB4vktOxZapaspY2fTC.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yhGCxn4pYIQhK52g6JjM4bL9fVX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1314481,\"title\":\"The Devil Wears Prada 2\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Andy Sachs returns to Runway as Miranda Priestly navigates a new media landscape and Runway's position within. The duo reconnect with former assistant Emily Charlton, now the head of a luxury brand that possesses funding which could ensure Runway's survival.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTI42pmsP5EDnvsNJPEDubwWBQO.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Af907x5h9W1wVis8XrSd7ynTWuy.jpg\"},{\"id\":936075,\"title\":\"Michael\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"The story of Michael Jackson, one of the most influential artists the world has ever known, and his life beyond the music. His journey from the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five, to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the world, highlighting both his life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm0KAbOjlt9eR5y7vDiL2dEOwMl.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ufSwlnECLoUbBjPrFqEQcWBzHwc.jpg\"},{\"id\":1668364,\"title\":\"Desire\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Lucero’s life appears immaculate: a wealthy household, a devoted husband, and two children who embody the promise of a perfect family. Yet beneath this surface simmers a quiet dissatisfaction. When Matías, a young swimming coach hired by her husband, enters their lives, Lucero finds herself pulled into a risky and consuming relationship. As secrecy, desire, and jealousy tighten their grip, the boundaries within the family begin to collapse, placing mother and daughter in a dangerous emotional triangle that threatens to shatter everything Lucero has built.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bEqHqeaQlFykaLQ7N4gDkIvL5w.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oBter8Y5p2ZFUwWgQ1T9pulGFTJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1439930,\"title\":\"The Punisher: One Last Kill\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"description\":\"As Frank Castle searches for meaning beyond revenge, an unexpected force pulls him back into the fight.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQclTgLMDvGBuUBFGHRipxkEwWR.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qO55CD8tgVL1T4WKn6zYFFiD6lL.jpg\"},{\"id\":1404304,\"title\":\"The Isolate Thief\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"A young woman struggles to conceal the gold she stole from a group of violent outlaws who have seized control of her remote outpost.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmmCh2BvTKp0YGT2FYG0eOQJELi.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mwqxKmbW6ssqa5CKHrgocqbkL0C.jpg\"},{\"id\":1728704,\"title\":\"Siping\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"A gripping story about a woman wagered in a high-stakes card game. But the stakes get even hotter when she’s won by the man who’s long been obsessed with her.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNzRyplxryB8s6jb8Be5dYAKZb5.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5XZqtQNB3XAnn7kFgU0XsSHbevV.jpg\"},{\"id\":278,\"title\":\"The Shawshank Redemption\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":1994,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"description\":\"Imprisoned in the 1940s for the double murder of his wife and her lover, upstanding banker Andy Dufresne begins a new life at the Shawshank prison, where he puts his accounting skills to work for an amoral warden. During his long stretch in prison, Dufresne comes to be admired by the other inmates -- including an older prisoner named Red -- for his integrity and unquenchable sense of hope.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cqNxx0GxF0bflZmeSMuL5tnGzr.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zfbjgQE1uSd9wiPTX4VzsLi0rGG.jpg\"},{\"id\":1419406,\"title\":\"The Shadow's Edge\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"Macau Police brings the tracking expert police officer out of retirement to help catch a dangerous group of professional thieves.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHKo3m8N1fwvEy2ZEr0xGmmMODV.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BtL2vvEufDXDP4u6xQjjQ1Y2aT.jpg\"},{\"id\":157336,\"title\":\"Interstellar\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2014,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"The adventures of a group of explorers who make use of a newly discovered wormhole to surpass the limitations on human space travel and conquer the vast distances involved in an interstellar voyage.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQvGrMoipbRoddT0ZR8tPoR7NfX.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5XNQBqnBwPA9yT0jZ0p3s8bbLh0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1487861,\"title\":\"Elize: Shadows of a Woman\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"In this retelling of a real case, a former escort discovers her wealthy husband's infidelity and struggles to cope as betrayal poisons their marriage.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3wevYWTpiZSUEM5B0Q8c21ALAD.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z8mTDyKdAWjKsD0vwa7e9LTSY1j.jpg\"},{\"id\":98894,\"title\":\"Jessica\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.1,\"release_year\":1962,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"When the men of a Sicilian village start obsessing over ravishing blonde midwife Jessica, angry females revolt by refusing to have sex with their husbands. As the local priest tries to encourage procreation, Jessica falls for a tricky recluse.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emXHuiMFjPuYKBE9FeIkmQNNmy.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dppTzXUPcEswCge1CoYcGOUV76m.jpg\"},{\"id\":238,\"title\":\"The Godfather\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":1972,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"description\":\"Spanning the years 1945 to 1955, a chronicle of the fictional Italian-American Corleone crime family. When organized crime family patriarch, Vito Corleone barely survives an attempt on his life, his youngest son, Michael steps in to take care of the would-be killers, launching a campaign of bloody revenge.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bhkrj58Vtu7enYsRolD1fZdja1.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tSPT36ZKlP2WVHJLM4cQPLSzv3b.jpg\"},{\"id\":1516698,\"title\":\"The Last Sunrise\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":0,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Ry, a college student with a chronic illness escapes to Mallorca for the summer with her mother, where she unexpectedly falls for a local and begins to embrace living in the moment. But as her condition worsens and long-hidden family secrets come to light, everything she has found before summer's end is threatened.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pego3yEZ5SuGvRjESKAguL4Wu7M.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lB7yPaRhJHQ9dx7AnvPUi0GZDU.jpg\"},{\"id\":872585,\"title\":\"Oppenheimer\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"description\":\"The story of J. Robert Oppenheimer's role in the development of the atomic bomb during World War II.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Gxv8gSFCU0XGDykEGv7zR1n2ua.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/neeNHeXjMF5fXoCJRsOmkNGC7q.jpg\"},{\"id\":1497463,\"title\":\"All That We Never Were\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"19-year-old Leah navigates a coming-of-age journey in the wake of a tragic car accident that claims her parents. Relocated to a coastal town under the care of her brother’s best friend Axel, Leah grapples with grief, haunting nightmares and a fractured sense of self.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqxIT48mWFsC4NSjGEHAcp1pjEo.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6cJUqJYfRu5HqLKPmG5NVUMOjuD.jpg\"},{\"id\":1086268,\"title\":\"Three\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Ivan and Vera are a young married couple. Both successful in their work, they live in a luxurious villa with their daughters, Petra and Vanja. Aleksandar is their best friend, an architect, as well as Vera's work colleague, who regularly spends time with Ivan and Vera. Aleksanadar and Ivan are friends from childhood, they often go out to nightclubs where Ivan leads a double life. Everything will change one day when the surprising proposal Alexander makes to Ivan does havoc in their lives.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mKQPfSpfR0BleflXfV5tyfsh3c.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bScbcVOg6ssfKjnIMidwNrtpOfz.jpg\"},{\"id\":550,\"title\":\"Fight Club\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":1999,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A ticking-time-bomb insomniac and a slippery soap salesman channel primal male aggression into a shocking new form of therapy. Their concept catches on, with underground \\\"fight clubs\\\" forming in every town, until an eccentric gets in the way and ignites an out-of-control spiral toward oblivion.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSziioSwPVrOy9Yow3XhWIBDjq1.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c6OLXfKAk5BKeR6broC8pYiCquX.jpg\"}],\"Action\":[{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"description\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPOn6DinuVyLY17YM9mKuPofV08.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qeQJx07rK2xm8SD2sJxFKhE7gs0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1368337,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/RMXG8myu1aGlNUsRjtxzmpdMK0.jpg\"},{\"id\":634649,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: No Way Home\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2021,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Peter Parker is unmasked and no longer able to separate his normal life from the high-stakes of being a super-hero. When he asks for help from Doctor Strange the stakes become even more dangerous, forcing him to discover what it truly means to be Spider-Man.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1g0dhYtq4irTY1GPXvft6k4YLjm.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/14QbnygCuTO0vl7CAFmPf1fgZfV.jpg\"},{\"id\":1081003,\"title\":\"Supergirl\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"When an unexpected and ruthless adversary strikes too close to home, Kara Zor-El, aka Supergirl, reluctantly joins forces with an unlikely companion on an epic, interstellar journey of vengeance and justice.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QCWdqzTfh2x9UylVpspIU6QTuM.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4X2YSe8PaYbsBqX3TDmmIU4vOju.jpg\"},{\"id\":1284465,\"title\":\"The Death of Robin Hood\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.2,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"description\":\"Grappling with his past after a life of crime and murder, Robin Hood finds himself gravely injured after a battle he thought would be his last. In the hands of a mysterious woman, he is offered a chance at salvation.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92Tsfx7SFafOqWsotvrlJbHyehd.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lh3BDkmWJh998n4fQcHYcVi7dpm.jpg\"},{\"id\":454639,\"title\":\"Masters of the Universe\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"After being separated for 15 years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia, where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan/Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the universe.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRuyGUHdoaQxWP3SDfafGkStxTC.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yQIdU11DYQQp0neGtGtGxbGfRer.jpg\"},{\"id\":1375646,\"title\":\"Colony\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Professor Se-jeong is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN799oUR0f1gUKDYdMNrDaY7I51.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDvxsBemt2Iyslg7qn2WMzgxz23.jpg\"},{\"id\":315635,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Homecoming\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2017,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Following the events of Captain America: Civil War, Peter Parker, with the help of his mentor Tony Stark, tries to balance his life as an ordinary high school student in Queens, New York City, with fighting crime as his superhero alter ego Spider-Man as a new threat, the Vulture, emerges.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c24sv2weTHPsmDa7jEMN0m2P3RT.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fn4n6uOYcB6Uh89nbNPoU2w80RV.jpg\"},{\"id\":1698863,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"description\":\"Based on the Ancient Greek epic. After ten years of war, King Odysseus sets sail for Ithaca, eager to reunite with his beloved. But his journey home is far more treacherous than the battlefield, as he must face deadly monsters and vengeful gods to survive.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBHCRB7zLIW41w8QskfwJhm32YF.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rOIaKlAX0SeNC25dFbM0y1mFsH6.jpg\"},{\"id\":557,\"title\":\"Spider-Man\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2002,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"After being bitten by a genetically altered spider at Oscorp, nerdy but endearing high school student Peter Parker is endowed with amazing powers to become the superhero known as Spider-Man.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXdAh5vUwERL4WGVMaee8RoDEAS.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zQ8AxTPiCiS5nnwXpwTBPBHSaa5.jpg\"},{\"id\":980431,\"title\":\"Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\"},{\"id\":1311031,\"title\":\"Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Infinity Castle\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"The Demon Slayer Corps are drawn into the Infinity Castle, where Tanjiro, Nezuko, and the Hashira face terrifying Upper Rank demons in a desperate fight as the final battle against Muzan Kibutsuji begins.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWVSwgjpT2D78VUh6X8UBd2rorW.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1RgPyOhN4DRs225BGTlHJqCudII.jpg\"},{\"id\":1630409,\"title\":\"The Debt Collector\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"description\":\"Tormented by past mistakes and a terminal diagnosis, an ex-debt collector returns to the underworld to protect the victims of a violent organization.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qADBUb5ybrkRVGZEFF8Z4RuOwys.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dk68ykaNd3HdrDJyPJqEGsgvag7.jpg\"},{\"id\":429617,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Far From Home\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Peter Parker and his friends go on a summer trip to Europe. However, they will hardly be able to rest - Peter will have to agree to help Nick Fury uncover the mystery of creatures that cause natural disasters and destruction throughout the continent.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q2NNj4S5dG2RLF9CpXsej7yXl.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vamhMTvh9m9zFHDoR0v1nRtf6T4.jpg\"},{\"id\":1110034,\"title\":\"Kraken\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A marine biologist is doing research on a fish farm when she encounters several strange occurrences. Along with the brutal deaths of two teenagers, all signs point to the deep fjord; can there be more to the depths than the eye can see?\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdZ8k5s8DTwWyPBMIcflrYLgcAK.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oV472EbPedkc5QzqolGc7sCgCnn.jpg\"},{\"id\":102382,\"title\":\"The Amazing Spider-Man 2\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2014,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"For Peter Parker, life is busy. Between taking out the bad guys as Spider-Man and spending time with the person he loves, Gwen Stacy, high school graduation cannot come quickly enough. Peter has not forgotten about the promise he made to Gwen’s father to protect her by staying away, but that is a promise he cannot keep. Things will change for Peter when a new villain, Electro, emerges, an old friend, Harry Osborn, returns, and Peter uncovers new clues about his past.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGjoPttcbKR5VWg1jQuNFB247KL.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k0hlAzTryCYX1O1LyC6P8tAa8s0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1930,\"title\":\"The Amazing Spider-Man\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.4,\"release_year\":2012,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"A teenage Peter Parker grapples with both high school and amazing super-human crises as his alter-ego Spider-Man.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jexoNYnPd6vVrmygwF6QZmWPFdu.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/HVcza6tJtWFrLriuh3Ano4Vt46.jpg\"},{\"id\":1594914,\"title\":\"Lucky Strike\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"War\"],\"description\":\"A wounded American soldier fights to survive behind enemy lines during WWII's Battle of the Bulge against the Germans, relying on his instinct, spy craft and a hand-radio to evade capture and find his way back to his unit.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzRAd7mj39ZY3FGNrDdZjqx56tn.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1ebY06Gc1eUZcCoO7IoD4tWCFxm.jpg\"},{\"id\":1228710,\"title\":\"The Mandalorian and Grogu\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin and his young apprentice Grogu.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GV5rrUJf0BRUhoh2cyFoeNthlQ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/MJcERawyqGqJdPsOBc0C449hQ9.jpg\"},{\"id\":299536,\"title\":\"Avengers: Infinity War\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2018,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"As the Avengers and their allies have continued to protect the world from threats too large for any one hero to handle, a new danger has emerged from the cosmic shadows: Thanos. A despot of intergalactic infamy, his goal is to collect all six Infinity Stones, artifacts of unimaginable power, and use them to inflict his twisted will on all of reality. Everything the Avengers have fought for has led up to this moment - the fate of Earth and existence itself has never been more uncertain.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WsyChQLEftFiDOVTGkv3hFpyyt.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDfJG3LC3Dqb67AZ52x3Z0jU0uB.jpg\"}],\"Horror\":[{\"id\":1339713,\"title\":\"Obsession\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"After breaking the mysterious \\\"One Wish Willow\\\" to win his crush's heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRwnj8WEKBCvmfeUNOukJPwB43K.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rZfmzpixLKLR3Hg2u0WgC7XLFl8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1284041,\"title\":\"The Last House\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A family suddenly sealed inside their home must work together to survive against dwindling resources and the ominous threat keeping them trapped.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JU7E8Vv2M11egkctWVOScxWR75.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2mPmccLg8QCD4ZF6v8kSsUijPPW.jpg\"},{\"id\":1481343,\"title\":\"The Devil's Mouth\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A group of college friends' Thailand adventure turns deadly when they become trapped in submerged caves with a dangerous predator. As oxygen runs low, past conflicts emerge in their desperate fight for survival.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lH8k9uCWYn2b2gsYleqYBDPbWa8.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/se8LfmZYFiNerF6U7zMUKePV0vE.jpg\"},{\"id\":1375646,\"title\":\"Colony\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Professor Se-jeong is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN799oUR0f1gUKDYdMNrDaY7I51.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDvxsBemt2Iyslg7qn2WMzgxz23.jpg\"},{\"id\":1083381,\"title\":\"Backrooms\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"A strange doorway appears in the basement of a furniture showroom.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhGx6E3qRNMgj3i5su2oukNHwIQ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dqmMWNWfLnExDRpMtIMqI97GQFR.jpg\"},{\"id\":1212763,\"title\":\"Evil Dead Burn\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"description\":\"After her husband's abrupt death, Alice seeks solace with his remaining family — descendants of a leading researcher on demonic possession. As her in-laws transform one by one into creatures that feed on fear, she comes to discover that the vows she took in life survive even in death.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRxrNXQWkHoENm3nwVOZDYSCx2F.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/biwEwIkjZhMUfXzz59bpeDzwYB6.jpg\"},{\"id\":1307118,\"title\":\"Soulm8te\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"After a ruthless tech giant acquires a small robotics company, a grieving engineer is tasked with testing their new AI companion. But when he attempts to reprogram her to be a truly sentient soulmate, she develops needs of her own—unleashing a relentless spree of precision-engineered mayhem.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNErActDctl6cdUGw9pnjSCmyhQ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ebcOSaZLxdCMHDjJJQzx5PiEyzl.jpg\"},{\"id\":1564614,\"title\":\"Leviticus\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"Two teenage boys must escape a violent entity that takes the form of the person they desire most:  each other.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnAsZvBygplNpp8PtjoTEYv3VPB.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7y8zWGEjs7tresw4Hzkkf4TdkcL.jpg\"},{\"id\":1510795,\"title\":\"Shake, Rattle & Roll: Evil Origins\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"description\":\"In 1775 during the Spanish colonial period in the Philippines, nuns attempts to survive the night after an unknown evil was set free in their cloister. Meanwhile in 2025, a group of friends attend a Halloween masquerade ball which was attacked by a serial killer. Fast forward to the future in 2050, a post-apocalytic Philippines is ruled by the aswang.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ayOQIh18qhJRoajoAxxGuZXry2.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/90Vx3KpCXR2D9iVdxJpkjeYBq9P.jpg\"},{\"id\":1110034,\"title\":\"Kraken\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A marine biologist is doing research on a fish farm when she encounters several strange occurrences. Along with the brutal deaths of two teenagers, all signs point to the deep fjord; can there be more to the depths than the eye can see?\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdZ8k5s8DTwWyPBMIcflrYLgcAK.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oV472EbPedkc5QzqolGc7sCgCnn.jpg\"},{\"id\":1127384,\"title\":\"Deep Water\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A group of international passengers on a flight from Los Angeles to Shanghai is forced to make an emergency landing in shark-infested waters. The terrified group is forced to work together and overcome their differences if they hope to escape their sinking plane and the frenzy of sharks drawn to the wreckage.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjcuS7xaRyqRjVaVcH4t0qHshuX.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/szKv713FcUXx6hcfdY369vtkmzr.jpg\"},{\"id\":1569947,\"title\":\"The Priest: Thanksgiving Massacre\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":1.7,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"description\":\"A family gather to spend Thanksgiving at an isolated cabin, unaware that the site has a horrific history of murder and cannibalism and that the Priest responsible did not rest in peace. Now they are on the menu for Thanksgiving dinner.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiRySv62247N91mfCCAryACGNuv.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1ldfkNbf3joNG8mA6idXoEL1fZV.jpg\"},{\"id\":1304313,\"title\":\"Lee Cronin's The Mummy\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"description\":\"The young daughter of a journalist disappears into the desert without a trace—eight years later, the broken family is shocked when she is returned to them, as what should be a joyful reunion turns into a living nightmare.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1q308iixueCU4pFtSYugNOevtNx.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xugEpZk9YQ0DIz1aFvH5HGkqpZK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1430698,\"title\":\"The Bay\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"description\":\"Best friends Emma and Lani, attending a destination wedding in Thailand, find themselves trapped on a sinking tour boat in the heart of a tiger shark sanctuary.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QQUI4J2zLv6f96TOjbz9dcg8bc.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qaMQOtAZ6K4RneNDa1yDlJv1V6J.jpg\"},{\"id\":1382832,\"title\":\"Hungry\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"description\":\"A group of holidaymakers must fight for their lives against a rampaging hippo on the loose after becoming lost in the Louisiana swamplands.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uNhvGxBDiO0mU5UhxuXBsJwKF3.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sUfwD6yMR740c2xvYopzv6JqOL3.jpg\"},{\"id\":1469342,\"title\":\"Her Private Hell\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.8,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"When a mysterious mist engulfs a futuristic metropolis, unleashing a deadly and elusive entity, a troubled young woman searches for her father. Her quest collides with an American GI on a harrowing odyssey to rescue his daughter from Hell.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiFacg75KVjy0AM3S4QmbPas8zL.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hS4FcOM5y71FurkBQgDLTBxmWZh.jpg\"},{\"id\":329505,\"title\":\"Lola's Secret\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":1984,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"description\":\"A young man's dreams come true when the sexy new maid seduces him. But she has a secret that leads to trouble.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaJ4iQngrLbyz9OgaQkJLppDN6m.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tId87yE7JnQsQsqOpnGXjz9PoEe.jpg\"},{\"id\":1631506,\"title\":\"The Hanged Woman\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.8,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"description\":\"Rosa Martín, a singer-songwriter known as La Ahorcada, takes her own life in the garden of the man she loved, Fran, who treated her as nothing more than a sexual object. The ghost of La Ahorcada remains in Fran's mansion, refusing to be ignored and determined to teach him a lesson. Her obsession will end up turning the lives of Fran and his family into a living hell.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5016vxLjYd5pmXezXNHYTbsjro.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9La8mRvH81YdUa6HwyQicVqIrUJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1272837,\"title\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Dr. Kelson finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's encounter with Jimmy Crystal becomes a nightmare he can't escape.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kK1BGkG3KAvWB0WMV1DfOx9yTMZ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hHDNOlATHhre4eZ7aYz5cdyJLik.jpg\"},{\"id\":1477712,\"title\":\"Ice Cream Man\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"An idyllic summer town descends into madness when an ice cream man serves kids sweet delights with horrifying results.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c987gxFjXqYOxZEZKcTkS1ONTWH.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/75pK9Dj1CheZFItgld9TVvb2P4x.jpg\"}],\"Science Fiction\":[{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"description\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPOn6DinuVyLY17YM9mKuPofV08.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qeQJx07rK2xm8SD2sJxFKhE7gs0.jpg\"},{\"id\":634649,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: No Way Home\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2021,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Peter Parker is unmasked and no longer able to separate his normal life from the high-stakes of being a super-hero. When he asks for help from Doctor Strange the stakes become even more dangerous, forcing him to discover what it truly means to be Spider-Man.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1g0dhYtq4irTY1GPXvft6k4YLjm.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/14QbnygCuTO0vl7CAFmPf1fgZfV.jpg\"},{\"id\":1081003,\"title\":\"Supergirl\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"When an unexpected and ruthless adversary strikes too close to home, Kara Zor-El, aka Supergirl, reluctantly joins forces with an unlikely companion on an epic, interstellar journey of vengeance and justice.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QCWdqzTfh2x9UylVpspIU6QTuM.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4X2YSe8PaYbsBqX3TDmmIU4vOju.jpg\"},{\"id\":1275779,\"title\":\"Disclosure Day\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A cybersecurity expert becomes a whistleblower after uncovering secrets about aliens, putting him on the run from a corporation. Meanwhile, a meteorologist experiencing strange phenomena joins forces with him to prove there's life beyond our understanding.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnJ8IQJI23hNpYXVNaythu061Ru.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/flxau5Iu7bChQHsESqvGZ3FQRaI.jpg\"},{\"id\":1284041,\"title\":\"The Last House\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"A family suddenly sealed inside their home must work together to survive against dwindling resources and the ominous threat keeping them trapped.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JU7E8Vv2M11egkctWVOScxWR75.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2mPmccLg8QCD4ZF6v8kSsUijPPW.jpg\"},{\"id\":454639,\"title\":\"Masters of the Universe\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"After being separated for 15 years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia, where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan/Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the universe.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRuyGUHdoaQxWP3SDfafGkStxTC.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yQIdU11DYQQp0neGtGtGxbGfRer.jpg\"},{\"id\":1375646,\"title\":\"Colony\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Professor Se-jeong is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN799oUR0f1gUKDYdMNrDaY7I51.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDvxsBemt2Iyslg7qn2WMzgxz23.jpg\"},{\"id\":315635,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Homecoming\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2017,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Following the events of Captain America: Civil War, Peter Parker, with the help of his mentor Tony Stark, tries to balance his life as an ordinary high school student in Queens, New York City, with fighting crime as his superhero alter ego Spider-Man as a new threat, the Vulture, emerges.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c24sv2weTHPsmDa7jEMN0m2P3RT.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fn4n6uOYcB6Uh89nbNPoU2w80RV.jpg\"},{\"id\":1083381,\"title\":\"Backrooms\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"A strange doorway appears in the basement of a furniture showroom.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhGx6E3qRNMgj3i5su2oukNHwIQ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dqmMWNWfLnExDRpMtIMqI97GQFR.jpg\"},{\"id\":557,\"title\":\"Spider-Man\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2002,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"After being bitten by a genetically altered spider at Oscorp, nerdy but endearing high school student Peter Parker is endowed with amazing powers to become the superhero known as Spider-Man.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXdAh5vUwERL4WGVMaee8RoDEAS.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zQ8AxTPiCiS5nnwXpwTBPBHSaa5.jpg\"},{\"id\":1307118,\"title\":\"Soulm8te\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"After a ruthless tech giant acquires a small robotics company, a grieving engineer is tasked with testing their new AI companion. But when he attempts to reprogram her to be a truly sentient soulmate, she develops needs of her own—unleashing a relentless spree of precision-engineered mayhem.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNErActDctl6cdUGw9pnjSCmyhQ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ebcOSaZLxdCMHDjJJQzx5PiEyzl.jpg\"},{\"id\":687163,\"title\":\"Project Hail Mary\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Adventure\"],\"description\":\"Science teacher Ryland Grace wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns, he begins to uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causing the sun to die out. He must call on his scientific knowledge and unorthodox ideas to save everything on Earth from extinction.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yihdXomYb5kTeSivtFndMy5iDmf.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Tfys3mDZVp4tNoH2ktm06a0Tau.jpg\"},{\"id\":429617,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Far From Home\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"Peter Parker and his friends go on a summer trip to Europe. However, they will hardly be able to rest - Peter will have to agree to help Nick Fury uncover the mystery of creatures that cause natural disasters and destruction throughout the continent.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q2NNj4S5dG2RLF9CpXsej7yXl.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vamhMTvh9m9zFHDoR0v1nRtf6T4.jpg\"},{\"id\":102382,\"title\":\"The Amazing Spider-Man 2\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2014,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"For Peter Parker, life is busy. Between taking out the bad guys as Spider-Man and spending time with the person he loves, Gwen Stacy, high school graduation cannot come quickly enough. Peter has not forgotten about the promise he made to Gwen’s father to protect her by staying away, but that is a promise he cannot keep. Things will change for Peter when a new villain, Electro, emerges, an old friend, Harry Osborn, returns, and Peter uncovers new clues about his past.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGjoPttcbKR5VWg1jQuNFB247KL.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k0hlAzTryCYX1O1LyC6P8tAa8s0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1930,\"title\":\"The Amazing Spider-Man\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.4,\"release_year\":2012,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"A teenage Peter Parker grapples with both high school and amazing super-human crises as his alter-ego Spider-Man.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jexoNYnPd6vVrmygwF6QZmWPFdu.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/HVcza6tJtWFrLriuh3Ano4Vt46.jpg\"},{\"id\":1228710,\"title\":\"The Mandalorian and Grogu\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin and his young apprentice Grogu.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GV5rrUJf0BRUhoh2cyFoeNthlQ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/MJcERawyqGqJdPsOBc0C449hQ9.jpg\"},{\"id\":299536,\"title\":\"Avengers: Infinity War\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2018,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"description\":\"As the Avengers and their allies have continued to protect the world from threats too large for any one hero to handle, a new danger has emerged from the cosmic shadows: Thanos. A despot of intergalactic infamy, his goal is to collect all six Infinity Stones, artifacts of unimaginable power, and use them to inflict his twisted will on all of reality. Everything the Avengers have fought for has led up to this moment - the fate of Earth and existence itself has never been more uncertain.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WsyChQLEftFiDOVTGkv3hFpyyt.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDfJG3LC3Dqb67AZ52x3Z0jU0uB.jpg\"},{\"id\":1698856,\"title\":\"Master of the Universe\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"A young man must use his untapped powers to fight back against an evil alien and their army, who will stop at nothing to take over Earth and then the universe.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a77OcLmarwiBJakOPPC36m58t4L.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uOQtyMV2G9yJvc0s14zmLoRC5H9.jpg\"},{\"id\":83533,\"title\":\"Avatar: Fire and Ash\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.8,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"In the wake of the devastating war against the RDA and the loss of their eldest son, Jake Sully and Neytiri face a new threat on Pandora: the Ash People, a violent and power-hungry Na'vi tribe led by the ruthless Varang. Jake's family must fight for their survival and the future of Pandora in a conflict that pushes them to their emotional and physical limits.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRBeSHfGHwkEpImlhxPmOcUsaeg.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sdZSjtGUTSN8B3al5o0f2WoQfQQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1656061,\"title\":\"Immortal Combat\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Science Fiction\",\"Adventure\"],\"description\":\"History's greatest warriors, including Genghis Khan and Joan of Arc, are summoned by a shadowy organization to fight in a battle to the death. But unknown to their captors, the fighters have been plotting to turn the tables and dismantle the deadly enterprise from within.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhRAgvQ04DTE4zQN3OSyc9Lonj3.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hwg3vj8MAXM8WISFnvjJsXXLHdw.jpg\"}],\"Romance\":[{\"id\":1564614,\"title\":\"Leviticus\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.3,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"Two teenage boys must escape a violent entity that takes the form of the person they desire most:  each other.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnAsZvBygplNpp8PtjoTEYv3VPB.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7y8zWGEjs7tresw4Hzkkf4TdkcL.jpg\"},{\"id\":47612,\"title\":\"Au Bonheur des Dames\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.1,\"release_year\":1930,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"Denise, an orphaned girl, moves to Paris where she hopes to find work at her uncle's store. But the glamorous department store 'Aux Bonheur des Dames' across the street crushes all the little businesses around. She finds a position there.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVFvFFEMRJ1eUzD6nbYLSqwHi0d.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o5bRLCNBmWBCBluFlOLUgivdONs.jpg\"},{\"id\":1523145,\"title\":\"Your Heart Will Be Broken\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"High school student Polina is saved from bullying at her new school and makes a deal with the main bully Bars: he must pretend to be her boyfriend and protect her, and she must do everything he says. During this game, the couple develops real feelings, but her family and classmates have reasons to separate the lovers.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wIBfBl2gejt6xHxNSK0reVIm7E.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1x9e0qWonw634NhIsRdvnneeqvN.jpg\"},{\"id\":1285366,\"title\":\"Shape of My Heart\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.1,\"release_year\":2024,\"genres\":[\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"A romance about a man and a woman who, due to an unexpected event, end up switching bodies. Despite coming from completely different backgrounds and environments, the two try to overcome the various difficulties that arise from their body swap.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3r0O6BW9USoZ9mteCVyNKMQriRL.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yjK3ardrgdS8suZG8KMU82Q7U38.jpg\"},{\"id\":98894,\"title\":\"Jessica\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":2.1,\"release_year\":1962,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"When the men of a Sicilian village start obsessing over ravishing blonde midwife Jessica, angry females revolt by refusing to have sex with their husbands. As the local priest tries to encourage procreation, Jessica falls for a tricky recluse.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emXHuiMFjPuYKBE9FeIkmQNNmy.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dppTzXUPcEswCge1CoYcGOUV76m.jpg\"},{\"id\":1516698,\"title\":\"The Last Sunrise\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":0,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Ry, a college student with a chronic illness escapes to Mallorca for the summer with her mother, where she unexpectedly falls for a local and begins to embrace living in the moment. But as her condition worsens and long-hidden family secrets come to light, everything she has found before summer's end is threatened.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pego3yEZ5SuGvRjESKAguL4Wu7M.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lB7yPaRhJHQ9dx7AnvPUi0GZDU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1497463,\"title\":\"All That We Never Were\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"19-year-old Leah navigates a coming-of-age journey in the wake of a tragic car accident that claims her parents. Relocated to a coastal town under the care of her brother’s best friend Axel, Leah grapples with grief, haunting nightmares and a fractured sense of self.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqxIT48mWFsC4NSjGEHAcp1pjEo.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6cJUqJYfRu5HqLKPmG5NVUMOjuD.jpg\"},{\"id\":1325734,\"title\":\"The Drama\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.4,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"A happily engaged couple is put to the test when an unexpected turn sends their wedding week off the rails.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnIOUhzwJDfgQakx8EjoNyItKgs.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1oKLEA9JOhvaBwLpqjROisvWMy7.jpg\"},{\"id\":82023,\"title\":\"Hotel Desire\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.1,\"release_year\":2011,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"Antonia is a single mother who works as a hotel maid in Berlin. A normal hot summer day takes a dramatic turn when she crosses paths with a particular guest of the hotel, famous blind portrait painter Julius Pass.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47XRWH95ATv4szxdWHl723guWXP.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wcUohmHc9oDZXarXDp905TYVui4.jpg\"},{\"id\":391312,\"title\":\"Mourning Wife\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":1.7,\"release_year\":2001,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"Director Daisuke Goto, the master of the cinematic Pink Eiga, is back with this retelling of the classic film noir, The Postman Always Rings Twice. A married woman, tasked with running her handicapped husband’s failing printing business, meets a drifter and they fall in love. Soon a plan to murder the husband is put into motion and the forces of fate begin to show their hand. Featuring bravura filmmaking, fantastic performances and steamy sex, the Mourning Wife is a worthy follow up for any fan of Daisuke Goto’s masterpiece A Lonely Cow Weeps at Dawn.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cfd33evWkw8TPq95WkHeU82m8O.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1KlBjmE84thylby7Y2OuR0ig3rg.jpg\"},{\"id\":952079,\"title\":\"Invited Delivery Man 2\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.5,\"release_year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"An erotic love film depicting a couple with sexual problems due to the muscular delivery man's erectile dysfunction and a female urologist.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41Q9zWeeZXJguvrSmZGDgci1cbB.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8umn1Rmptegqz9cUIoMzQm6smdt.jpg\"},{\"id\":1010581,\"title\":\"My Fault\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"Noah must leave her city, boyfriend, and friends to move into William Leister's mansion, the flashy and wealthy husband of her mother Rafaela. As a proud and independent 17 year old, Noah resists living in a mansion surrounded by luxury. However, it is there where she meets Nick, her new stepbrother, and the clash of their strong personalities becomes evident from the very beginning.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w46Vw536HwNnEzOa7J24YH9DPRS.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oz4U9eA6ilYf1tyiVuGmkftdLac.jpg\"},{\"id\":1432631,\"title\":\"Idhayam Murali\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.8,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"A young man navigates the complexities of unrequited love, finding that even as years pass and life takes unexpected turns, certain emotions remain deeply embedded in his heart.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PsaTAiEw3RroUB5BpBKD96SXA9.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jLncLuPE5kOascGrvN39jgQHVJT.jpg\"},{\"id\":597,\"title\":\"Titanic\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":1997,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"101-year-old Rose DeWitt Bukater tells the story of her life aboard the Titanic, 84 years later. A young Rose boards the ship with her mother and fiancé. Meanwhile, Jack Dawson and Fabrizio De Rossi win third-class tickets aboard the ship. Rose tells the whole story from Titanic's departure through to its death—on its first and last voyage—on April 15, 1912.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xjZS2rlVxm8SFx8kPC3aIGCOYQ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xnHVX37XZEp33hhCbYlQFq7ux1J.jpg\"},{\"id\":1218925,\"title\":\"Chainsaw Man - The Movie: Reze Arc\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"In a brutal war between devils, hunters, and secret enemies, a mysterious girl named Reze has stepped into Denji's world, and he faces his deadliest battle yet, fueled by love in a world where survival knows no rules.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crBfxNvvsQV3rATX12EuX4W9ECo.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rI4waA7VlRAynrYUUpiPScsdPm8.jpg\"},{\"id\":13,\"title\":\"Forrest Gump\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":1994,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"description\":\"A man with a low IQ has accomplished great things in his life and been present during significant historic events—in each case, far exceeding what anyone imagined he could do. But despite all he has achieved, his one true love eludes him.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Cw4hIUIAmSYfK9QfaUW5igp9La.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/66Kn4XWhkuPkJxOJyPEx4U2CUfN.jpg\"},{\"id\":11036,\"title\":\"The Notebook\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.9,\"release_year\":2004,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"An epic love story centered around an older man who reads aloud to a woman with Alzheimer's. From a faded notebook, the old man's words bring to life the story about a couple who is separated by World War II, and is then passionately reunited, seven years later, after they have taken different paths.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNzQyW4f8B8cQeg7Dgj3n6eT5k9.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zdXnJqBaGFVtLoPNuMeKfEYUViZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":372058,\"title\":\"Your Name.\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2016,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"High schoolers Mitsuha and Taki are complete strangers living separate lives. But one night, they suddenly switch places. Mitsuha wakes up in Taki’s body, and he in hers. This bizarre occurrence continues to happen randomly, and the two must adjust their lives around each other.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q719jXXEzOoYaps6babgKnONONX.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8x9iKH8kWA0zdkgNdpAew7OstYe.jpg\"},{\"id\":1156594,\"title\":\"Our Fault\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Jenna and Lion's wedding brings about the long-awaited reunion between Noah and Nick after their breakup. Nick's inability to forgive Noah stands as an insurmountable barrier. He, heir to his grandfather's businesses, and she, starting her professional life, resist fueling a flame that's still alive. But now that their paths have crossed again, will love be stronger than resentment?\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzqHt4m1SeY9FbPrfZ0C2Hi9x1s.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7QirCB1o80NEFpQGlQRZerZbQEp.jpg\"},{\"id\":950396,\"title\":\"The Gorge\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"avg_rating\":3.8,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"description\":\"Two highly trained operatives grow close from a distance after being sent to guard opposite sides of a mysterious gorge. When an evil below emerges, they must work together to survive what lies within.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iMBZzVZtG0oBug4TfqDb9ZxAOa.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9nhjGaFLKtddDPtPaX5EmKqsWdH.jpg\"}]},\"tvShows\":[{\"id\":51025,\"title\":\"Paradise Hotel\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":2.8,\"release_year\":2005,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"description\":\"Danish version of the reality series \\\"Paradise Hotel\\\".\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycSBcACecVR0zSnP2ZF83k5f7he.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nun8Ssmni886Ib4v7chgQbswDfl.jpg\"},{\"id\":94997,\"title\":\"House of the Dragon\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Action & Adventure\"],\"description\":\"The Targaryen dynasty is at the absolute apex of its power, with more than 15 dragons under their yoke. Most empires crumble from such heights. In the case of the Targaryens, their slow fall begins when King Viserys breaks with a century of tradition by naming his daughter Rhaenyra heir to the Iron Throne. But when Viserys later fathers a son, the court is shocked when Rhaenyra retains her status as his heir, and seeds of division sow friction across the realm.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7V0Ebks0GgpKvQ7QbLAIdX5dos4.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/etj8E2o0Bud0HkONVQPjyCkIvpv.jpg\"},{\"id\":5920,\"title\":\"The Mentalist\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2008,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"description\":\"Patrick Jane, a former celebrity psychic medium, uses his razor sharp skills of observation and expertise at \\\"reading\\\" people to solve serious crimes with the California Bureau of Investigation.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acYXu4KaDj1NIkMgObnhe4C4a0T.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q3pCsNvJ7CmdJUz2sJEEUY3pOPC.jpg\"},{\"id\":233643,\"title\":\"Secret Mission - Undercover Agents Never Back Down!\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.1,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Animation\"],\"description\":\"Narcotics Enforcement Agent Riko Ikazuchi is undercover with her junior colleague Noma in an apartment that serves as the hideout for a criminal organization. Despite Riko and Noma posing as a newlywed couple, the criminals begin to suspect them after not hearing any marital intimacy during the night. To convince them that they are a loving couple, Noma starts touching Riko's body...\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZV8e1iKi85PFZlbQBdznvtpAVJ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5IBSPGPAEFEkEJo4leqvpq0RcKf.jpg\"},{\"id\":113962,\"title\":\"Lioness\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War & Politics\"],\"description\":\"Cruz Manuelos, a rough-around-the-edges but passionate young Marine, is recruited to join the CIA's Lioness Engagement Team to help bring down a terrorist organization from within. Joe, the station chief of the Lioness program, is tasked with training, managing and leading her female undercover operatives.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzpHPSEgPTpRs8EHbygwsOw7jC0.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4NBYDOnEjAzyuP7CMkD5s7fs44K.jpg\"},{\"id\":2734,\"title\":\"Law & Order: Special Victims Unit\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":1999,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"description\":\"In the criminal justice system, sexually-based offenses are considered especially heinous. In New York City, the dedicated detectives who investigate these vicious felonies are members of an elite squad known as the Special Victims Unit. These are their stories.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iofokHZoUB4Qhik4PflvJl8TT6a.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/obtdxPgmfykYwVnvuYXC5f2xKlQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":79744,\"title\":\"The Rookie\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2018,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Starting over isn't easy, especially for small-town guy John Nolan who, after a life-altering incident, is pursuing his dream of being an LAPD officer. As the force's oldest rookie, he's met with skepticism from some higher-ups who see him as just a walking midlife crisis.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70kTz0OmjjZe7zHvIDrq2iKW7PJ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6iNWfGVCEfASDdlNb05TP5nG0ll.jpg\"},{\"id\":1416,\"title\":\"Grey's Anatomy\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2005,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Follows the personal and professional lives of a group of doctors at Seattle's Grey Sloan Memorial Hospital.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjJkrLXhWvGHpLeLBDFznpBTY1S.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jP0Rhj9OTPDAwQlHQwOLFDdeE8t.jpg\"},{\"id\":36109,\"title\":\"Paradise Hotel\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":2.6,\"release_year\":2009,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"description\":\"Norwegian girls and boys check in at the Paradise Hotel in Mexico, where Triana Iglesias is the hotel manager. The hotel has great views and a fantastic pool. Cameras with a full view of the idyllic site tells the story of what happens when the single boys and girls meet in the hot surroundings of the hotel. The task they have is basically simple: Find a partner or check out.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6KhQBpW4gdcoSp9JQvQFq14lFI.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/naUighMJIjHGQJIXSj7wMOgKbSd.jpg\"},{\"id\":125988,\"title\":\"Silo\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.1,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"In a ruined and toxic future, thousands live in a giant silo deep underground. After its sheriff breaks a cardinal rule and residents die mysteriously, engineer Juliette starts to uncover shocking secrets and the truth about the silo.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMYZZvnkVNTqSVnVCphWbPXwWwb.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uTWhbLc7Bj4qNSdW3ZvZKL8cOHv.jpg\"},{\"id\":65334,\"title\":\"Miraculous: Tales of Ladybug & Cat Noir\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":2015,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Kids\"],\"description\":\"Marinette and Adrien, two Parisian teenagers, are entrusted with powerful jewels in order to transform into superheroes Ladybug and Cat Noir. But neither hero knows the other's true identity — or that they're classmates!\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acrtAy8gmxcsEvrDP09MpMSCeDZ.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lH22EnM0ofC7GsVGU8dAA2RXV1c.jpg\"},{\"id\":549,\"title\":\"Law & Order\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.6,\"release_year\":1990,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"In cases ripped from the headlines, police investigate serious and often deadly crimes, weighing the evidence and questioning the suspects until someone is taken into custody. The district attorney's office then builds a case to convict the perpetrator by proving the person guilty beyond a reasonable doubt. Working together, these expert teams navigate all sides of the complex criminal justice system to make New York a safer place.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haJ9eHytVO3H3JooMJG1DiWwDNm.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tc7canPSAn2X14hYi6Rl3gZm1o4.jpg\"},{\"id\":60625,\"title\":\"Rick and Morty\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2013,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Action & Adventure\"],\"description\":\"Follows a sociopathic genius scientist who drags his inherently timid grandson on adventures across the universe.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owhkU6KRqdXoUQpjV8uyZGPtX58.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iFOkrSrJRwE27PwbyQeYLlMJXzw.jpg\"},{\"id\":1622,\"title\":\"Supernatural\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.2,\"release_year\":2005,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"When they were boys, Sam and Dean Winchester lost their mother to a mysterious and demonic supernatural force. Subsequently, their father raised them to be soldiers. He taught them about the paranormal evil that lives in the dark corners and on the back roads of America ... and he taught them how to kill it. Now, the Winchester brothers crisscross the country in their '67 Chevy Impala, battling every kind of supernatural threat they encounter along the way. \",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8iixmfGx5EIFPdpNvB2JvI3VIqX.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ro0tlgnsco4SwbdAgmscLkSlMSL.jpg\"},{\"id\":4614,\"title\":\"NCIS\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.8,\"release_year\":2003,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Action & Adventure\"],\"description\":\"From murder and espionage to terrorism and stolen submarines, a team of special agents investigates any crime that has any connection to Navy and Marine Corps personnel, regardless of rank or position.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBcu8d6x6zB1el3MPNl7cZQEQ31.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nn3SuLTO4hum8yAxaY4ql8h6kRk.jpg\"},{\"id\":67707,\"title\":\"Paradise Hotel\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":2.5,\"release_year\":2005,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"description\":\"A group of hot singles check into a luxury hotel in Mexico. Prepare for love, partying, betrayal and tears. Half a million kronor is at stake and anything can happen in paradise.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeU8fC5JaG2BkWqgMX7yPfX7dfW.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jv7E1Fr6roiVQSvql6bWqOQVDC9.jpg\"},{\"id\":456,\"title\":\"The Simpsons\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4,\"release_year\":1989,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Set in Springfield, the average American town, the show focuses on the antics and everyday adventures of the Simpson family; Homer, Marge, Bart, Lisa and Maggie, as well as a virtual cast of thousands. Since the beginning, the series has been a pop culture icon, attracting hundreds of celebrities to guest star. The show has also made name for itself in its fearless satirical take on politics, media and American life in general.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWpG7GqfKGQqX4YMAo3nv5OrglV.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jIArNHIekrCSVgdMbKPAXpPY03Y.jpg\"},{\"id\":1434,\"title\":\"Family Guy\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":3.7,\"release_year\":1999,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Sick, twisted, politically incorrect and Freakin' Sweet animated series featuring the adventures of the dysfunctional Griffin family. Bumbling Peter and long-suffering Lois have three kids. Stewie (a brilliant but sadistic baby bent on killing his mother and taking over the world), Meg (the oldest, and is the most unpopular girl in town) and Chris (the middle kid, he's not very bright but has a passion for movies). The final member of the family is Brian - a talking dog and much more than a pet, he keeps Stewie in check whilst sipping Martinis and sorting through his own life issues.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PFsEuAiyLkWsP4GG6dIV37Q6gu.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l7wShoIdIUwaDIbsHno9pO5MZXT.jpg\"},{\"id\":124364,\"title\":\"FROM\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"Unravel the mystery of a nightmarish town in middle America that traps all those who enter. As the unwilling residents fight to keep a sense of normalcy and search for a way out, they must also survive the threats of the surrounding forest – including the terrifying creatures that come out when the sun goes down.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRtJagIxpfODzzb0T0NAvZSzErC.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xLdw1xdHocKYFFvx7w41NchXMfJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":22980,\"title\":\"Watch What Happens Live with Andy Cohen\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":2.5,\"release_year\":2009,\"genres\":[\"Talk\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Bravo network executive Andy Cohen discusses pop culture topics with celebrities and reality show personalities.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onSD9UXfJwrMXWhq7UY7hGF2S1h.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hINekSpbcBxjnjGqmIm6I4bz2ab.jpg\"},{\"id\":276161,\"title\":\"Teach You a Lesson\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.7,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"An inspector from the Educational Rights Protection Bureau (ERPB) who is authorized by the government to use physical intervention and unconventional methods to discipline delinquent students and reform the educational system.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMECSPrTmRClSViMsXFYmiYIcWP.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vyG93jhmPL7tBIhRtCLa5mdBKob.jpg\"},{\"id\":299167,\"title\":\"Dutton Ranch\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.6,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Rip Wheeler and Beth Dutton gamble everything on a new life in South Texas, but the promise of building a future far from the ghosts of Yellowstone quickly collides with brutal new realities and a rival ranch that will stop at nothing to protect its empire.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsiecCxd8lkcAluw0wWwbW5CwSv.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wh5agdl3b7fqC7mSjsCkHx4fMAs.jpg\"},{\"id\":1396,\"title\":\"Breaking Bad\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.5,\"release_year\":2008,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"description\":\"Walter White, a New Mexico chemistry teacher, is diagnosed with Stage III cancer and given a prognosis of only two years left to live. He becomes filled with a sense of fearlessness and an unrelenting desire to secure his family's financial future at any cost as he enters the dangerous world of drugs and crime.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anFx9aTOOYqgS3v7x3R84Kz67ly.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tsRy63Mu5cu8etL1X7ZLyf7UP1M.jpg\"},{\"id\":273240,\"title\":\"Off Campus\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.5,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Hannah Wells tutors hockey captain Garrett Graham to win over her crush. Their deal becomes real connection as they face their pasts. Friends Logan, Dean, Tucker, and Allie navigate college life and love.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcPc5ZMBO4y2BtCJMe3o2nwZb2B.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/TGJ34SvYJ2ZgzsOgAaXzSx3o7E.jpg\"},{\"id\":259837,\"title\":\"The WONDERfools\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.5,\"release_year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"A goofy group of townies stumbles into superpowers and fights rising evil as doomsday panic grows in this wild, turn-of-the-century action comedy.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jj7AYkz2OLRDL1wfJmjTXyWQ5I4.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/810mXC0xkxXVtoKIPGGVgO9PuLh.jpg\"},{\"id\":209867,\"title\":\"Frieren: Beyond Journey's End\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"After the party of heroes defeated the Demon King, they restored peace to the land and returned to lives of solitude.  Generations pass, and the elven mage Frieren comes face to face with humanity’s mortality. She takes on a new apprentice and promises to fulfill old friends’ dying wishes. Can an elven mind make peace with the nature of life and death? Frieren embarks on her quest to find out.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqZENchTd7lp5zht7BdlqM7RBhD.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rBOnrVlck7BIlGeWVlzYiZeg4l2.jpg\"},{\"id\":85077,\"title\":\"The Chosen\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"The life of Christ through the eyes of those who encountered him.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqVUFuNrMFWt7uGNWlpo91VKYOI.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3siv3RaQrdr2tQiv9jHq71sLlzo.jpg\"},{\"id\":246,\"title\":\"Avatar: The Last Airbender\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2005,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"In a war-torn world of elemental magic, a young boy reawakens to undertake a dangerous mystic quest to fulfill his destiny as the Avatar, and bring peace to the world.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaGt4GIutpbXHsv48tWceWg6s56.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kU98MbVVgi72wzceyrEbClZmMFe.jpg\"},{\"id\":64010,\"title\":\"Reply 1988\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2015,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"description\":\"Take a nostalgic trip back to the late 1980s through the lives of five families and their five teenage kids living in a small neighbourhood in Seoul.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3xQJlQRff4k5IMEY55l4iKaKl3.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wgmikRStgBbrzjxFVe5rhFlpL2R.jpg\"},{\"id\":219246,\"title\":\"When Life Gives You Tangerines\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"In Jeju, a spirited girl and a steadfast boy's island story blossoms into a lifelong tale of setbacks and triumphs — proving love endures across time.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VC3sEFxYXYDqQUCAnvWfUsYg1s.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a9qlroMOHewiDsUR93PYMVfpbF5.jpg\"},{\"id\":94605,\"title\":\"Arcane\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2021,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\"],\"description\":\"Amid the stark discord of twin cities Piltover and Zaun, two sisters fight on rival sides of a war between magic technologies and clashing convictions.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqldf2t8ztc9aiwn3k6mlX3tvRT.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q8eejQcg1bAqImEV8jh8RtBD4uH.jpg\"},{\"id\":37854,\"title\":\"One Piece\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":1999,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Animation\"],\"description\":\"Years ago, the fearsome Pirate King, Gol D. Roger was executed leaving a huge pile of treasure and the famous \\\"One Piece\\\" behind. Whoever claims the \\\"One Piece\\\" will be named the new King of the Pirates.\\n\\nMonkey D. Luffy, a boy who consumed a \\\"Devil Fruit,\\\" decides to follow in the footsteps of his idol, the pirate Shanks, and find the One Piece. It helps, of course, that his body has the properties of rubber and that he's surrounded by a bevy of skilled fighters and thieves to help him along the way.\\n\\nLuffy will do anything to get the One Piece and become King of the Pirates!\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dB4EDhre2dsC2kxYDavyKWqLQwi.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2rmK7mnchw9Xr3XdiTFSxTTLXqv.jpg\"},{\"id\":301507,\"title\":\"Heated Rivalry\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Two of the biggest stars in Major League Hockey are bound by ambition, rivalry, and a magnetic pull neither of them fully understands. What begins as a secret fling between two fresh faced rookies evolves into a years-long journey of love, denial, and self-discovery. Over the next eight years, as they chase glory on the ice, they struggle to navigate their feelings for each other. Torn between the sport they live for and the love they can’t ignore, they must decide if there’s room in their fiercely competitive world for something as fragile – and powerful – as real love.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YCKbtAkYWCMDLHvkUjGhG7eWoS.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iS76c29IrS3lKI2X5CFySguiAWU.jpg\"},{\"id\":250307,\"title\":\"The Pitt\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2025,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"The staff of Pittsburgh's Trauma Medical Center work around the clock to save lives in an overcrowded and underfunded emergency department.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvFSpESyBZMjaeOJDx7RS3P1jey.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z3BkMbCy5ajZPMyKEUwsPHuz2cV.jpg\"},{\"id\":87108,\"title\":\"Chernobyl\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"The true story of one of the worst man-made catastrophes in history: the catastrophic nuclear accident at Chernobyl. A tale of the brave men and women who sacrificed to save Europe from unimaginable disaster.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlLXt2tOPT6RRnjiUmoxyG1LTFi.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3URK0z9PzpVNJrGE7XOuyy6KFzk.jpg\"},{\"id\":31911,\"title\":\"Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2009,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Disregard for alchemy’s laws ripped half of Edward Elric’s limbs from his body and left his brother Alphonse’s soul clinging to a suit of armor. To restore what was lost, the brothers seek the Philosopher’s Stone. Enemies and allies – the corrupt military, the Homunculi, and foreign alchemists – will alter the Elric brothers course, but their purpose will remain unchanged and their bond unbreakable.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZFUEOULaVml7pQuXxhpR2SmVUw.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2UG177tWHy7xRmMKWJHB7nAUmKd.jpg\"},{\"id\":60059,\"title\":\"Better Call Saul\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.4,\"release_year\":2015,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"Six years before Saul Goodman meets Walter White. We meet him when the man who will become Saul Goodman is known as Jimmy McGill, a small-time lawyer searching for his destiny, and, more immediately, hustling to make ends meet. Working alongside, and, often, against Jimmy, is “fixer” Mike Ehrmantraut. The series tracks Jimmy’s transformation into Saul Goodman, the man who puts “criminal” in “criminal lawyer\\\".\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjg4jpK1Wp2kiRvtt5ND0kznako.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rfxryDIv8huejujg4JueDJx8zCz.jpg\"},{\"id\":200709,\"title\":\"Weak Hero\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Action & Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"description\":\"With the aid of unexpected friends, a gifted but introverted student confronts bullies and violent foes — unaware of how dangerous his world will become.\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Sd01WeraL2oA3Vv6O4rcRxockn.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q5mJ4oKfGc6Cr9reIHFzD0pQzre.jpg\"},{\"id\":1429,\"title\":\"Attack on Titan\",\"type\":\"series\",\"avg_rating\":4.3,\"release_year\":2013,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"Action & Adventure\"],\"description\":\"100 years ago, the last remnants of humanity were forced to retreat behind the towering walls of a fortified city to escape the massive, man-eating Titans that roamed the land outside their fortress. Only the members of the Scouting Legion dared to stray beyond the safety of the walls – but even those brave warriors seldom returned alive. Those within the city clung to the illusion of a peaceful existence until the day that dream was shattered, and their slim chance at survival was reduced to one horrifying choice: kill – or be devoured!\",\"cover_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTP1DtLGFamjfu8WqjnuQdP1n4i.jpg\",\"backdrop_url\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rqbCbjB19amtOtFQbb3K2lgm2zv.jpg\"}],\"continueWatching\":[],\"recommended\":[],\"becauseYouWatched\":{\"source\":null,\"items\":[]}}"
          },
